# GitHub Pages site

The repository contains a static documentation site under docs/ and a workflow to publish it through GitHub Pages.

## Expectations

- Keep docs/index.html as the landing page and ensure it links to the main docs pages.
- Add or update a page under docs/ whenever a user-facing capability, workflow, or mathematical formulation changes.
- Keep the site self-contained and avoid referencing unpublished features as if they were already implemented.
- When the deployment workflow changes, verify that docs/ is still the publish path.
